{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "LTX Restore: Deblur (IC-LoRA Deblur 0.9)",
    "description": "Core ComfyUI nodes only (LTX-2.5 support in ComfyUI core). Distilled LTX-2.5 22B (int8), 8 fixed sigmas, euler_ancestral, cfg 1 (LTXVDualCFGGuider 1/1). IC-LoRA: LoraLoaderModelOnly -> GetICLoRAParameters -> LTXVAddGuide(source frames, frame_idx 0, strength 1) on an empty latent of the same size and length, stage 1 only at native resolution (reference downscale factor 1), LTXVCropGuides drops the guide frames before decoding. The source is trimmed from its start, resampled to 8n+1 frames (VideoFrameSample uniform) and scaled/centre-cropped to the target size (multiples of 32). The generated audio latent is discarded; source audio kept. Deblur 0.9 brings defocused footage back into focus (defocus blur, not motion blur). Model card template with the DEBLUR keyword. Trained at 960x544, 121 frames at 24 fps. LTX-2 Community License (ltx-2.x-community-license, gated on Hugging Face)."
  },
